cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Domain-Stratified NMT Corpus Builder
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: singhmanyu
    email: abhi.nmt2022@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/singhmanyu/Domain-Stratified-NMT-Corpus-Builder
abstract: >-
  A two-stage domain classifier that splits a large English-Nepali parallel
  corpus into nine domains for stratified NMT training. Stage 1 routes with
  nvidia/domain-classifier; the rows its taxonomy cannot place are decided by
  a fastText classifier trained on LLM-generated seed labels, so no
  hand-labelled training set is required.
keywords:
  - domain classification
  - machine translation
  - parallel corpus
  - weak supervision
  - knowledge distillation
  - low-resource languages
  - nepali
license: MIT
